# Validate with visudo before installation:
#   visudo -cf ops/aurevia-deploy.sudoers
#
# One rule per environment pins the environment argument and the archive to
# that environment's name in the inbox; the helper re-checks both. Both rules
# belong to the shared deploy account until each environment has its own CI
# account (ops/AUTO-DEPLOY.md, "Separate the environments on the VPS").
deploy ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/local/sbin/aurevia-deploy staging /home/deploy/aurevia-incoming/staging-*.tar.gz *
deploy ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/local/sbin/aurevia-deploy production /home/deploy/aurevia-incoming/production-*.tar.gz *
